# Allow-list for `docker build -f relay/Dockerfile .` (build context = repository root). Everything is excluded except what the
# relay-only configure reads: the root CMakeLists, versions.json, cmake/, the sdk, ipc, net and relay sources, and the season
# manifests (cmake/WpiEmuVersions.cmake reads seasons/<year>/season.json and seasons/abi/*.json even in relay-only builds).
# Keeps .git, build trees, the app, the game plugins and the docs out of the context (small, cache-stable, no secrets).
*

!CMakeLists.txt
!versions.json
!cmake
!sdk
!ipc
!net
!relay
!seasons/*/season.json
!seasons/abi/*.json

# Tests are not built in the image.
**/tests
**/build*
**/*.md
relay/Dockerfile
